            </note>
            <note corresp="#d624-f2" n="34" xml:id="d624-f2-content">
                <p>Maj. Demos T. Craw, Assistant Military Attaché for Air at the Legation in
                    Greece.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d624-f3" n="35" xml:id="d624-f3-content">
                <p>Through Bulgaria, which began March 1, upon adhesion of Bulgaria to the
                    Tripartite Pact; for text of pact, signed between Japan, Germany, and Italy,
                    September 27, 1940, see League of Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">cciv</hi>, p. 386.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
